{
  "id": 442944144,
  "iid": 22947,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "p4rpc: Fixup truncation",
  "description": "Don't call ws_utf8_truncate unless we wrote to the end of the buffer\n(and thus there's possibly a truncated UTF-8 codepoint); this prevents\nUB with the end of the string buffer not being initialized.\n\nThis shows a reason why snprintf is tricky, remembering which parameters\ninclude the null terminator and which ones don't.\n\nFix #20922 (while keeping #20916 fixed.)",
  "state": "merged",
